        "answer": "Handle poor communication by establishing agreed-upon calling windows rather than expecting spontaneous daytime replies. Acknowledge that corporate demands and exhausting commutes drain physical energy, and focus on delivering genuine emotional warmth during evening check-ins instead of demanding non-stop text availability throughout the workday."
